{"id":"47fd4f254629657d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTSubtermRow.md","title":"MTSubtermRow","display":"MTSubtermRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MTSubtermRow","parameters":["z1713","z1714","z1715"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MTSubtermRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1713</span><span>z1714</span><span>z1715</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>z1713</code>、<code>z1714</code>、<code>z1715</code>。</p>\n<p>约束类型子项（包括自身）。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MTSubtermRow z1713 z1714 z1715)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists x\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair x t z1715)\n      (and\n        (@ MType x)\n        (and\n          (@ MType t)\n          (or\n            (= x t)\n            (exists z1718\n              (exists z1719\n                (and\n                  (@ TArr z1718 z1719 t)\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1720\n                      (exists z1721 (and (in z1720 z1714) (and (@ App z1713 z1720 z1721) (@ Pair x z1718 z1721)))))\n                    (exists z1722\n                      (exists z1723 (and (in z1722 z1714) (and (@ App z1713 z1722 z1723) (@ Pair x z1719 z1723)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfb4f26b2207f720\" href=\"?note=dfb4f26b2207f720\" title=\"ZFC_MType\">MType</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MTSubtermRow z1713 z1714 z1715)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MType","status":"resolved","id":"dfb4f26b2207f720","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TArr","status":"resolved","id":"2f67326629fff1ce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""